"P2925240359" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen> $name! Some of my troops ran into trouble somewhere in the Forgotten Forest.  They're currently North of your position, pinned down and taking heavy fire.<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>They wandered into a real mess out there but they've also located the heart of the Shivan assault force.<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>I'm not sure how much longer they can hold their position though and we shouldn't let this opportunity pass!  I'm sending along their coordinates, please hurry! Over."
